          "text": "=======================================================\nKRAHASIMI I LLOJEVE Te GRAFEVE\n=======================================================\n\nGraf i thjeshte:\n  Rendi  |V| = 5\n  Permasa |E| = 5\n  A: fuqi = 2\n  B: fuqi = 2\n  C: fuqi = 2\n  D: fuqi = 3\n  E: fuqi = 1\n\nGraf i plote K₄:\n  Rendi  |V| = 4\n  Permasa |E| = 6\n  A: fuqi = 3\n  B: fuqi = 3\n  C: fuqi = 3\n  D: fuqi = 3\n\nDigraf:\n  Rendi  |V| = 5\n  Permasa |E| = 6\n  A: fuqi-hyrese=1, fuqi-dalese=1\n  B: fuqi-hyrese=2, fuqi-dalese=2\n  C: fuqi-hyrese=1, fuqi-dalese=1\n  D: fuqi-hyrese=1, fuqi-dalese=1\n  E: fuqi-hyrese=1, fuqi-dalese=1",
